# Roll the ball around and jump; the pickups near the start get collected.
10 capture /tmp/claude-1000/roll_start.png
20 press d
120 release d
130 tap space
140 press w
260 release w
270 press a
400 release a
401 capture /tmp/claude-1000/roll_mid.png
700 capture /tmp/claude-1000/roll_end.png
701 quit
